    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0450" n="278" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg278"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/596</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Price</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-11T23:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 11, 1917, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received midnight.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Supplementing my May 11, 3 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d380-f1"/> Salvador’s reply
                    same as Honduras’s. Nicaragua simply applauds the initiative. Guatemala
                    [accepts?] in principle and states that it will appoint a delegate as soon as
                    details are known.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
